## Implementation Phases

### Phase 1: Core Protocol & Codec (Week 1)
1. Extend protobuf schema with codec negotiation and mic control
2. Integrate libopus into server-core (vcpkg)
3. Implement `OpusEncoder` / `OpusDecoder` classes
4. Add packet header with sequence numbers and timestamps
5. Implement adaptive jitter buffer
6. Test PC→Phone streaming with Opus codec

### Phase 2: Phone Mic → PC (Week 2)
1. Add `RECORD_AUDIO` permission to Android app
2. Implement `MicCaptureService` with `AudioRecord`
3. Build Opus JNI bridge for Android
4. Implement `MicReceiver` on PC (write to VB-CABLE)
5. Implement `VirtualMicMonitor` for on-demand activation
6. Test bidirectional streaming

### Phase 3: Dear ImGui PC App (Week 2-3)
1. Create `server-gui` project with Dear ImGui + Win32 + D3D11
2. Port server-core integration from MFC to new GUI
3. Implement system tray icon with context menu
